Subject: gas: add i386-substrate target

Plain ELF assembler target — no substrate-specific assembler quirks.  The OSABI byte is stamped by ld, not gas.

---
diff --git a/gas/configure.tgt b/gas/configure.tgt
--- a/gas/configure.tgt	2026-05-11 21:33:54.006747926 -0500
+++ b/gas/configure.tgt	2026-05-11 21:35:35.252255340 -0500
@@ -243,6 +243,7 @@
   i386-*-lynxos*)			fmt=elf em=lynx ;;
   i386-*-redox*)			fmt=elf ;;
   i386-*-solaris*)			fmt=elf em=solaris ;;
+  i386-*-substrate*)			fmt=elf ;;
   i386-*-freebsd* \
   | i386-*-kfreebsd*-gnu)		fmt=elf em=freebsd ;;
   i386-*-msdosdjgpp* \
